1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,410
Mobile repair seekha, par gali mein das dukaanein pehle se hain.

2
00:00:04,710 --> 00:00:12,794
Tinku, sheher mein ab hazaaron e-rickshaw hain, par unka mechanic koi nahi! E-rickshaw service aur battery swap khol!

3
00:00:13,094 --> 00:00:15,446
Battery swap? Wo kya hota hai, Chacha?

4
00:00:15,746 --> 00:00:22,621
Khaali battery nikaalo, full battery lagao, do minute mein! Paanch battery aur charger, dhai lakh.

5
00:00:22,921 --> 00:00:28,152
Controller, motor aur wiring ki repair bhi seekh. Wahin roz ka kaam hai.

6
00:00:28,702 --> 00:00:32,355
Tinku bhai, battery khatam! Sawaari baithi hai, jaldi karo!

7
00:00:32,655 --> 00:00:36,186
Do minute, Bittu bhai. Full battery, 150 rupaye!

8
00:00:36,486 --> 00:00:40,670
Roz 20 swap aur repair, dhai hazaar se zyada roz.

9
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:45,603
Phir drivers ke liye monthly plan bana. Har din fix grahak.

10
00:00:45,903 --> 00:00:48,758
Battery full, dhandha full! Tinku ki life set!
